## Chef Miso's C lessons, one per restaurant level, in programming-learning
## order: 1 syntax, variables and arithmetic; 2 if / else and switch;
## 3 loops; 4 arrays; 5 functions. Explanations follow the W3Schools C
## Tutorial (https://www.w3schools.com/c/), in our own words with kitchen
## examples. Generated from a source list; every example is compiled by the
## interpreter tests.
##
